---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Changelog - Tempo"
  description="What changed in each release of Tempo. Tempo updates itself through Sparkle; this page is the plain-language record of what each version brings.">
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Changelog</h1>
    <p class="meta">What each release of Tempo brings. Updates arrive automatically through Sparkle.</p>

    <h2>Version 1.1 <span class="ver-date">· June 2026</span></h2>
    <p>
      The biggest update since launch. A lot landed here: new ways to get events
      into Tempo, a much larger catalog of ready-made sources, and a faster, more
      capable timeline.
    </p>

    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Apple Shortcuts &amp; Focus.</strong> Send anything from your
        iPhone, iPad, or Mac straight into your timeline: a Focus turning on or
        off, bedtime, arriving home, or a tap on a Shortcut you built yourself. A
        new Shortcuts source ties it all together.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Encrypted ingestion.</strong> Turn on TLS for the senders that
        need it, one at a time. It's off by default (the plain local-network path
        stays the easy default), and you require it per sender when the data or the
        network calls for it.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>A dozen new bundled sources.</strong> The catalog is now twenty
        ready-made sources and growing: this release adds Beszel, Jellyfin,
        Jellyseerr, Sonarr, Radarr, Prowlarr, Vaultwarden, Pi-hole, Synology,
        Todoist, the new Shortcuts source, and an experimental Fastmail calendar.
        Install any of them with one click from Manage Sources.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Timeline filter.</strong> Flip between everything on the timeline
        and just what needs your attention.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Activity heatmap.</strong> See a source's recent activity at a
        glance, right in its panel.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Remove a source.</strong> Manage Sources now removes a source
        (keeping or clearing its history), not only installs one.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improved</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Faster and lighter.</strong> The timeline stays smooth and memory
        stays low even with tens of thousands of events.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Search that takes you there.</strong> Click a result to jump
        straight to the event and its actions.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Actions that know when to hide.</strong> A button that needs
        information an event didn't include now stays out of the way instead of
        sitting there broken.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Backups and cleanup.</strong> Scheduled and on-demand backups to a
        folder you choose, plus automatic history trimming so the database doesn't
        grow forever.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>A sound on new events.</strong> Optional, per source, with a
        single master switch.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Tidier sources.</strong> Related sources group neatly under one
        parent (UniFi, Hazel, Apple), and the source list stays clean.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Help that finds the right page.</strong> The macOS Help menu lists
        every guide chapter, so a search lands on the topic you need.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixed</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Many fixes across the timeline, sources, and event handling: fewer
        surprises and steadier counts throughout.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <hr />
    <p class="older">
      Releases before 1.1 predate this page. The current build and its checksum
      are always on the <a href="/downloads/">downloads page</a>.
    </p>
  </main>

  <style>
    .legal {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 48px auto;
      padding: 0 24px 80px;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .legal h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .legal h2 {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .legal h2 .ver-date {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--text2);
    }
    .legal h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--text);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .legal .meta {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text2);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .legal ul { padding-left: 22px; }
    .legal li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .legal hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin: 40px 0 24px;
    }
    .legal .older {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text2);
    }
    .legal a { color: var(--blue); }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
